  'html' => '<h3>Outline</h3>
<p><strong>1. Where Does the Money Come From?</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Federal grants (FEMA, HUD)</li>
<li>State funding (North Carolina disaster relief)</li>
<li>Private foundations (Cisco, Land of Sky, etc.)</li>
<li>Partner organizations (Habitat, CHC, etc.)</li>
<li>Individual donations</li>
